 "description": "Opens a line: calls on it spend bought time and carry no payment. op: open {channelId} takes the channelId buy_time returned and answers {nonce, sign}; sign the text in sign with the payer key (EIP-191, personal_sign); prove {channelId, nonce, signature} returns the credential; on, off, status, close {credential}. Time burns only while a call runs; an open websocket subscription burns the whole time it is open.\nExample: {\"op\":\"open\",\"channelId\":\"<the channelId buy_time returned>\"}",
